  "title": "Becel® Anything Goes Cookie Dough",
  "description": "Start your cookie creations with this 'Anything Goes Cookie Dough' and add flavorings and mix-ins to your liking; the cookies turn out soft and chewy, guaranteed.",
  "authors": [
